THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project integrates with, but does not bundle, the following:

  * OpenClaw (https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw) — the host whose internal
    hook API and `openclaw` CLI are used by plugins/openclaw-hook-dsh-bridge.
  * DeepSeek Harness / DSH (https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) —
    the host whose Cordis plugin API is used by plugins/dsh-webhook-bridge.
  * @tencent-weixin/openclaw-weixin — the WeChat channel plugin for OpenClaw.

Each third-party component keeps its own license and copyright. Consult those
projects before redistributing anything that links against them.

